{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"elf_bladewarden","model_identifier":"elf_bladewarden","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# elf_bladewarden\n\nElf bladewarden (A3), elite warrior, 1.9 m = 68 u (hair to 69).\n\nElf elite in light leaf-plate: overlapping leaf scales on chest and hips, layered leaf pauldrons, leaf tassets over the thighs, steel bracers and greaves, silver circlet, long straight hair. Wields a high-quality steel glaive (2.1 m, long curved blade) two-handed, with a long knife sheathed at the left hip as backup. Baseline skeleton and slot names.\n\n- Cubes: 37 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -10.0..10.0, y 0.0..68.8, z -6.0..4.5 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 16 x 69 x 12 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0\n- glaive reach: blade tip about 55 u in front of the right hand (slash/thrust)\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `guard` | 2.4 | loop | glaive guard, blade forward and up (loop) |\n| `slash` | 1 | once | key 0.40 s: blade sweeps through the target (wide flat right-to-left arc; wind-up 0.25 s, follow-through 0.55 s) |\n| `thrust` | 0.8 | once | key 0.34 s: point reaches full extension (stab) |\n| `switch_knife` | 1.2 | once | key 0.25 s: glaive released (hide `glaive` / drop it); key 0.55 s: knife drawn (hide `long_knife_sheathed`, show `long_knife`); ends in knife guard |\n| `knife_guard` | 2 | loop | long knife held forward (loop) |\n| `knife_slash` | 0.6 | once | key 0.26 s: knife cut lands (quick diagonal) |\n| `idle` | 4 | loop | glaive upright at the right side |\n| `walk` | 1 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.6 | loop |  |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | flinch from the front |\n| `death` | 1.3 | hold | falls on the back, holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 53.3 u/s (1.50 m/s), cycle 1.0 s\n- `run`: 177.8 u/s (5.00 m/s), cycle 0.6 s\n\n## Key times\n\n- `slash`: key 0.40 s: blade sweeps through the target (wide flat right-to-left arc; wind-up 0.25 s, follow-through 0.55 s)\n- `thrust`: key 0.34 s: point reaches full extension (stab)\n- `switch_knife`: key 0.25 s: glaive released (hide `glaive` / drop it); key 0.55 s: knife drawn (hide `long_knife_sheathed`, show `long_knife`); ends in knife guard\n- `knife_slash`: key 0.26 s: knife cut lands (quick diagonal)\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 68, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 47.5, 4)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (2.5, 51.5, 4)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (4, 57.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 45.5, -4)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (7, 30.5, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-10, 38.5, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-7, 30.5, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (5.5, 37, 2)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-5.5, 37, 2)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- `glaive` (visible, under slot_hand_r): about 2.1 m (75 u), grip at the origin 20 u from the butt, curved steel blade 16 u long along -Z, edge down (-Y)\n- `long_knife_sheathed` (visible, under slot_hip_l): long knife in its scabbard\n- `long_knife` (hidden, under slot_hand_r): the drawn long knife, blade 13 u (37 cm)\n\n## Second grips (two-handed items)\n\n- glaive: second grip (left hand) 17 u along the shaft forward of the right-hand grip (guard, slash, thrust, run)\n\n## Variant textures (same UV layout)\n\n- `elf_bladewarden_silver.png`: silver hair\n- `elf_bladewarden_gold.png`: pale gold hair\n- `elf_bladewarden_black.png`: black hair\n\n## Notes\n\n- Item swaps in switch_knife are left to the game (Blockbench clips cannot toggle visibility).\n"},"description":"# elf_bladewarden\n\nElf bladewarden (A3), elite warrior, 1.9 m = 68 u (hair to 69).\n\nElf elite in light leaf-plate: overlapping leaf scales on chest and hips, layered leaf pauldrons, leaf tassets over the thighs, steel bracers and greaves, silver circlet, long straight hair. Wields a high-quality steel glaive (2.1 m, long curved blade) two-handed, with a long knife sheathed at the left hip as backup. Baseline skeleton and slot names.\n\n- Cubes: 37 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -10.0..10.0, y 0.0..68.8, z -6.0..4.5 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 16 x 69 x 12 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0\n- glaive reach: blade tip about 55 u in front of the right hand (slash/thrust)\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `guard` | 2.4 | loop | glaive guard, blade forward and up (loop) |\n| `slash` | 1 | once | key 0.40 s: blade sweeps through the target (wide flat right-to-left arc; wind-up 0.25 s, follow-through 0.55 s) |\n| `thrust` | 0.8 | once | key 0.34 s: point reaches full extension (stab) |\n| `switch_knife` | 1.2 | once | key 0.25 s: glaive released (hide `glaive` / drop it); key 0.55 s: knife drawn (hide `long_knife_sheathed`, show `long_knife`); ends in knife guard |\n| `knife_guard` | 2 | loop | long knife held forward (loop) |\n| `knife_slash` | 0.6 | once | key 0.26 s: knife cut lands (quick diagonal) |\n| `idle` | 4 | loop | glaive upright at the right side |\n| `walk` | 1 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.6 | loop |  |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | flinch from the front |\n| `death` | 1.3 | hold | falls on the back, holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 53.3 u/s (1.50 m/s), cycle 1.0 s\n- `run`: 177.8 u/s (5.00 m/s), cycle 0.6 s\n\n## Key times\n\n- `slash`: key 0.40 s: blade sweeps through the target (wide flat right-to-left arc; wind-up 0.25 s, follow-through 0.55 s)\n- `thrust`: key 0.34 s: point reaches full extension (stab)\n- `switch_knife`: key 0.25 s: glaive released (hide `glaive` / drop it); key 0.55 s: knife drawn (hide `long_knife_sheathed`, show `long_knife`); ends in knife guard\n- `knife_slash`: key 0.26 s: knife cut lands (quick diagonal)\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 68, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 47.5, 4)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (2.5, 51.5, 4)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (4, 57.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 45.5, -4)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (7, 30.5, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-10, 38.5, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-7, 30.5, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (5.5, 37, 2)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-5.5, 37, 2)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- `glaive` (visible, under slot_hand_r): about 2.1 m (75 u), grip at the origin 20 u from the butt, curved steel blade 16 u long along -Z, edge down (-Y)\n- `long_knife_sheathed` (visible, under slot_hip_l): long knife in its scabbard\n- `long_knife` (hidden, under slot_hand_r): the drawn long knife, blade 13 u (37 cm)\n\n## Second grips (two-handed items)\n\n- glaive: second grip (left hand) 17 u along the shaft forward of the right-hand grip (guard, slash, thrust, run)\n\n## Variant textures (same UV layout)\n\n- `elf_bladewarden_silver.png`: silver hair\n- `elf_bladewarden_gold.png`: pale gold hair\n- `elf_bladewarden_black.png`: black hair\n\n## Notes\n\n- Item swaps in switch_knife are left to the game (Blockbench clips cannot toggle visibility).\n","resolution":{"width":128,"height":128},"elements":[{"name":"pelvis","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-4.5,34.0,-2.5],"to":[4.5,38.0,2.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,34.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[117,77,126.0,81.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[9,82,14.0,86.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0,82,9.0,86.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[14,82,19.0,86.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[33,77,42